    <item>
      <title>MdView 0.1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 16:29:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <link>https://github.com/gorbunov/mdview/releases/tag/v0.1.1</link>
      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Links to web pages and other files now ask before opening and show where they lead.</li><li>Apps, scripts and installers are never launched from a document; MdView offers to show them in Finder instead.</li><li>Remote images are blocked until you click Load Remote Images. To always load them, turn on Settings → Privacy → Load remote images automatically.</li><li>Documents can only load local images, audio and video.</li></ul>]]></description>
